    "enUS": {
      "description": "You have done well and helped me, and the mountain, greatly.\r\n\r\nI am just preparing some stew, and I would be glad to share it if you would help me gather some of the ingredients.\r\n\r\nWhile I am loath to slay any among the wild animals, the cycle of life requires sustenance. A balance of ingredients would serve us well. A few Hyjal Venison Cuts from the Hyjal Stags would pair well with the starchy roots of the Scarlet Dart Tuber plants that grow in the green places nearby.",
      "dialogue": {
        "cf50029b09dce3979d88": "Wonderful. Let us enjoy what nature has to offer.",
        "d2d4635e4fa7af74b7e7": "How goes the foraging?"
      },
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 1,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Hyjal Venison Cut",
          "type": "item"
        },
        {
